      "document_id": "doc_fixture",
      "page": 4,
      "char_start": 129,
      "char_end": 483,
      "quote": "Room rent shall be limited to 1% of Sum Insured per day. In case the Insured occupies a room with rent exceeding the eligible limit, all associated medical expenses including surgeon fees, operation theatre charges, and diagnostic charges shall be proportionately reduced in the same ratio as the eligible room rent bears to the actual room rent charged.",
